The syntax is as follows:

disklabel -rwt advfs "diskname" "disktype"

Example:

disklabel -rwt advfs rz0 rz29b

Then, make your file domain and fileset.

mkfdmn "domain name"
mkfset "domain name" "fileset"

Hope this helps.

Ken Gordon




