'cc' has the flags '-taso' and '-xtaso_short' which will give you 32 bit
pointers.  For the longs, I recommend typedef'ing 'Long' (or something
similar) to 'int' and then globally replace 'long' with 'Long'.

We don't have the C++ compiler, so I don't know if this holds true for
it.

Tim
